<description>&lt;p&gt;Intense intercommunal fighting in Rumbek has left at least 71 dead, including soldiers, and prompted the caretaker governor to return to Lakes State, highlighting a sharp escalation from the low‑level violence previously recorded. The clashes follow the killing of the Akobo commissioner and a recent sentencing of a soldier to ten years for murdering a UN worker, underscoring persistent ethnic tensions and impunity. This surge in civilian casualties contrasts with the two battle‑related deaths recorded in 2024, according to UCDP, indicating a significant rise in lethal communal violence.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Eye Radio&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimgFBVV95cUxPaUU0ZkpMWXVnTktFVWJRUnFBM1dvTVdYbWQxclRLMHd5d0VQdUJrWW1aV2FCbHpTdHFZX2tab25WTXpRTXVXYktTVXBfV3VKMW8ySFNKOEh1bU1ZOE9RRHRJZ05hci10OGdvNUlYOGMyLVc0UEhmMFlUVEhxNURKTzdGWUs4SjNBZk1XZTJYVGdaZ3JMdjllX2t3?oc=5&quot;&gt;PM News Nigeria&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Eye Radio&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqgFBVV95cUxNZmMzcTlKNTdqZ1lmZFppZlE0WUtSNlFtalZDZ1JJTzdIRnFPY2phRmZjYzJjQUFuS0EyYnplTEdDeFFObjFmV0RielNib0tmTDNURzAwVUdJQ2p5d3JLMUhOT1daaXl0YmktTnhCRElyYkZTbU5BRUlHeHM2U3ZfejI5LVBTNEdpTUxrUm5oakJMOTUtb1ZndHVUQ2xTTkh1TzZwQ1Bub04zZw?oc=5&quot;&gt;أفريكا نيوز&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinAFBVV95cUxPd0V1WkVZak5lQUtkdXRVVGhGNHR4alVtTmRndUQtUEl4ZVV4eXpmcDRfVXhLcmRJcG9YR2xINXBZNXk0dm8teXBSX2NBcGdjMUxKN1k1MG9sV3hfZl9yWk9lLVotb2N3blVFRW1ycklUbFNpczBtdDd0aVItNk5saUxUeERyMnFoMHFudTBFeEJtQ3RTN0pETjdfNVI?oc=5&quot;&gt;Latest news from Azerbaijan&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;WION&lt;/a&gt;